{"title":"Career roadmap — Diet Counsellor","role":"Diet Counsellor","summary":"A Diet Counsellor helps individuals understand nutrition, develop practical eating habits, and follow personalized dietary plans within their professional scope. The role combines nutrition science, dietary assessment, behaviour change, meal planning, communication, health education, and nutrition monitoring.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Nutrition & Dietetics"},"about":[{"label":"Direct alignment","text":"★★★★★ — B.Sc. Nutrition & Dietetics is a highly relevant undergraduate pathway. For clinical nutrition and therapeutic diet planning, additional professional qualifications, supervised clinical training, and applicable local regulations should be considered."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build nutrition science, assessment, counselling and food-science fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Diet Counsellor → Nutrition Counsellor → Clinical/Community Nutrition roles"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Nutritionist → Nutrition Programme Coordinator / Wellness Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead nutrition services, preventive-health programmes, digital nutrition and nutrition education"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Core learning","Practical exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Human biology, biochemistry, food science, nutrition fundamentals"},{"text":"Food analysis and basic dietary assessment"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Human nutrition, metabolism, meal planning, lifecycle nutrition"},{"text":"Community nutrition and supervised counselling"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Clinical nutrition, therapeutic diets, behaviour change, nutrition assessment"},{"text":"Hospital/community internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4 / Honours"},{"text":"Advanced counselling, public health, research, nutrition technology"},{"text":"Case studies + supervised counselling project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the nutrition foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Physiology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Food science"},{"text":"Basic microbiology"},{"text":"Introduction to nutrition"},{"text":"Macronutrients"},{"text":"Micronutrients"},{"text":"Energy metabolism"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Psychology fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbohydrates"},{"text":"Proteins"},{"text":"Fats"},{"text":"Vitamins"},{"text":"Minerals"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Fibre"},{"text":"Energy balance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how nutrition affects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Development"},{"text":"Metabolism"},{"text":"Immunity"},{"text":"Physical performance"},{"text":"General wellbeing"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Mini-project","text":"Analyze the nutritional composition of a typical weekly diet and identify nutrient gaps using standard food-composition references."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Build dietary assessment skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dietary history"},{"text":"24-hour dietary recall"},{"text":"Food-frequency questionnaires"},{"text":"Food diaries"},{"text":"Anthropometric measurements"},{"text":"BMI and its limitations"},{"text":"Waist measurements"},{"text":"Nutritional screening"},{"text":"Dietary pattern analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Lifecycle nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infant nutrition"},{"text":"Child nutrition"},{"text":"Adolescent nutrition"},{"text":"Adult nutrition"},{"text":"Pregnancy nutrition"},{"text":"Older-adult nutrition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Meal planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Portion planning"},{"text":"Balanced diets"},{"text":"Food exchanges"},{"text":"Vegetarian meal planning"},{"text":"Regional diets"},{"text":"Budget-conscious meal planning"},{"text":"Cultural food preferences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Food science"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food composition"},{"text":"Cooking methods"},{"text":"Nutrient losses"},{"text":"Food preservation"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Food labels"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Become counselling-ready"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Study the nutrition principles associated with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diabetes"},{"text":"Obesity"},{"text":"Cardiovascular conditions"},{"text":"Hypertension"},{"text":"Gastrointestinal disorders"},{"text":"Kidney disease"},{"text":"Liver conditions"},{"text":"Anaemia"},{"text":"Malnutrition"},{"text":"Food allergies/intolerances"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that therapeutic nutrition requires appropriate clinical training and scope-of-practice awareness."},{"type":"h","text":"Behaviour change"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Motivational interviewing fundamentals"},{"text":"Goal setting"},{"text":"Habit formation"},{"text":"Relapse management"},{"text":"Client adherence strategies"},{"text":"Cultural sensitivity"},{"text":"Non-judgmental communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Counselling"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Assessment","nutrition problem identification","realistic goals","meal/lifestyle strategy","follow-up","monitoring","adjustment"]},{"type":"note","label":"Major project","text":"Conduct supervised nutrition counselling case studies covering dietary assessment, goal setting, meal planning and follow-up."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional 