n Assistant"},{"text":"Wellness Nutritionist"},{"text":"Community Nutrition Worker"},{"text":"Nutrition Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Nutrition Consultant — where legally permitted"},{"text":"Dietary Support Professional"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Adjacent careers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Nutrition Assistant"},{"text":"Public Health Nutrition Assistant"},{"text":"Sports Nutrition Assistant"},{"text":"Corporate Wellness Coordinator"},{"text":"Health Coach"},{"text":"Nutrition Research Assistant"},{"text":"Nutrition Content Specialist"},{"text":"Health Education Specialist"},{"text":"Community Health Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Digital Nutrition Associate"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Scope note","text":"Titles such as Dietitian or clinical roles involving therapeutic diet prescription may have specific qualification, registration, or institutional requirements. Students should verify the applicable rules before using protected or regulated professional titles."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer assessment areas"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Macronutrients"},{"text":"Micronutrients"},{"text":"Energy requirements"},{"text":"Dietary assessment"},{"text":"Meal planning"},{"text":"Lifecycle nutrition"},{"text":"Food labels"},{"text":"Nutrition deficiencies"},{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Counselling"},{"text":"Clinical nutrition basics"},{"text":"Public health nutrition"},{"text":"Food safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical counselling scenario"},{"type":"p","text":"A client repeatedly abandons a calorie-controlled meal plan after two weeks."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong counsellor should not simply reduce calories further."},{"type":"p","text":"Instead:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Assess adherence barriers","understand food preferences/routine","identify unrealistic restrictions","establish achievable goals","modify meal structure","use behaviour-change techniques","agree on monitoring metrics","schedule follow-up"]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is sustainable behaviour change rather than a rigid short-term diet."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG option","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Sc. Nutrition & Dietetics"},{"text":"Direct specialization"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Clinical Nutrition"},{"text":"Clinical nutrition"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Food & Nutrition"},{"text":"Broad nutrition"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Public Health Nutrition"},{"text":"Population health"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Sports Nutrition"},{"text":"Sports/performance"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Applied Nutrition"},{"text":"Applied nutrition"}],[{"text":"MPH"},{"text":"Public health"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Food Science"},{"text":"Food/nutrition science"}],[{"text":"MBA Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Healthcare management"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong combinations"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition & Dietetics + Clinical Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition & Dietetics + Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition & Dietetics + Sports Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition & Dietetics + Behaviour Change"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition & Dietetics + Health Data"}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Relevant areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Nutrition, dietetics, public health"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Nutrition science, dietetics, public health"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Nutrition, dietetics, public health"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Nutrition, dietetics, sports nutrition"}],[{"text":"🇳🇿 New Zealand"},{"text":"Nutrition, public health"}],[{"text":"🇮🇪 Ireland"},{"text":"Nutrition science, public health"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Nutrition, health sciences"}],[{"text":"🇸🇪 Sweden"},{"text":"Nutrition, public health"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"Nutrition science, health sciences"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"Nutrition, public health"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"In countries where dietitian is a regulated profession, an international student generally needs the country's specific accredited education, supervised practice and registration pathway. A B.Sc. from India does not automatically confer local dietitian registration."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Counselling route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Nutrition & Dietetics","Nutrition Intern","Diet/Nutrition Counsellor","Senior Nutrition Counsellor","Nutrition Programme Coordinator","Nutrition Services Manager","Head of Nutrition / Wellness"]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","Clinical Nutrition Training","Supervised Clinical Experience","Eligible Clinical Nutrition/Dietetics Role","Senior Clinical Professional","Clinical Nutrition Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Public-health route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition Graduate","Community Nutrition Assistant","Nutrition Programme Officer","Public Health Nutrition Specialist","Programme Manager","Nutrition Programme Lead"]},{"type":"note","label":"Emerging specialisations","text":"2030–2040"},{"type":"p","text":"Nutrition counselling is increasingly moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personalized nutrition"},{"text":"Digital nutrition coaching"},{"text":"Wearable health data"},{"text":"Continuous glucose monitoring"},{"text":"AI-assisted dietary analysis"},{"text":"Behaviour-change technology"},{"text":"Precision nutrition"},{"text":"Nutrigenomics"},{"text":"Gut microbiome research"},{"text":"Tele-nutrition"},{"text":"Population nutrition analytics"},{"text":"Preventive health"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly valuable combination will be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition","Behaviour Science","Data","Digital Health"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital tools and AI will increasingly assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dietary pattern analysis"},{"text":"Food recognition"},{"text":"Meal tracking"},{"text":"Nutrient calculations"},{"text":"Personalization"},{"text":"Adherence monitoring"},{"text":"Risk prediction"},{"text":"Follow-up reminders"},{"text":"Population nutrition analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, humans remain essential for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understanding client context"},{"text":"Behaviour-change counselling"},{"text":"Cultural considerations"},{"text":"Motivational support"},{"text":"Interpreting complex situations"},{"text":"Identifying when medical referral is required"},{"text":"Ethical decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated meal recommendations should not replace qualified clinical assessment, especially for people with medical conditions or complex nutritional needs."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition Science","Human Nutrition","Biochemistry","Physiology","Food Science"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Assessment","Dietary Recall","Food Diary","Nutritional Screening","Anthropometry","Dietary Analysis"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Counselling","Active Listening","Motivational Interviewing","Goal Setting","Behaviour Change","Follow-up"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical/Public Health","Clinical Nutrition","Community Nutrition","Preventive Nutrition","Nutrition Education"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital","Excel","Nutrition Software","Data Analysis","Tele-Nutrition","AI-Assisted Nutrition"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Advanced","Precision Nutrition","Nutrigenomics","Microbiome","Digital Health"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target professional profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition Professional","Diet Counsellor","Behaviour-Change Specialist","Digital Nutrition Practitioner"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a direct pathway from B.Sc. Nutrition & Dietetics into nutrition counselling and wellness roles. For clinical dietetics, the roadmap should be extended with